  dialogueLines:
  - Hello there little slime!
  - If you could, lend us a hand,
  - the creatures of the night wish to take down the kings castle.
  - If you wish to help us, use A/D to go left and right...
  - And use SPACE to jump!
  - Grow larger through absorbing others,
  - and get big enough to take down the castle!
